        "kind": "theorem",
        "title": "Stationary point and classification of a nonsingular quadratic response surface",
        "statement": "For symmetric nonsingular B, the second-order response-surface polynomial has unique stationary point x0=-B^{-1}beta/2; its eigenvalue signs classify a minimum, maximum, or saddle.",
